a nonprofit mental health app reviewing website that's been called the Consumer Reports of Digital Mental Health. He is also a professor in the Department of Social Ecology at the University of California Irvine, where he works on developing and evaluating digital mental health technologies with the goal of expanding access to mental health care. Welcome to speaking of psychology, Dr. Schuller. Thanks so much. I'm really excited to be on here.
这是一个非营利性的心理健康应用评测网站，被称为数字心理健康领域的《消费者报告》。他同时也是加州大学尔湾分校（University of California, Irvine）社会生态学系的教授，在那里他致力于开发和评估数字心理健康技术，目标是扩大心理健康服务的获取渠道。欢迎来到“心理学对话”，舒勒博士。非常感谢。我很高兴能来到这里。

