正如我刚才在开场白中提到的，“同一个心智网络导向”被称为数字心理健康领域的《消费者报告》。它为什么会有这个绰号？这代表什么意思？这是我们在市场上真正需要的东西吗？嗯，我绝对认为这是我们在市场上需要的东西。现在有各种各样的数字心理健康产品，其中绝大多数都是应用程序。

5
00:01:52.000 --> 00:02:31.000
So if you were to go to the App Store, and to put in the search box, depression, anxiety, stress, PTSD, you would get tens of thousands of responses across those different terms. In fact, some estimates suggest that there's about 20 to 25,000 mental health apps that are out there and trying to find a good one is like finding a needle in a haystack. And so definitely we find that a lot of consumers do need some help in terms of separating the good from the bad, the effective from the not effective, the science backed from the ones that aren't science back. And what we do at One Mind Cyber Guide is we identify and we review products on multiple dimensions.
因此，如果你打开应用商店，在搜索框中输入抑郁、焦虑、压力、PTSD，你会在这些不同的词条下得到数万条结果。事实上，据一些估计，目前大约有2万到2.5万款心理健康应用，要在其中找到一款好的应用就像大海捞针。因此，我们确实发现许多消费者在区分好与坏、有效与无效、有科学依据与没有科学依据方面需要一些帮助。我们在“同一个心智网络导向”所做的工作是，从多个维度识别并评测产品。

6
00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:53.000
We look at how credible is it? Does it have science backing that this product actually works? Is it based off of evidence-based techniques? We look at the user experience. Is it easy to learn, easy to use, easy to navigate? Is it free from technical glitches? And we look at issues around data security and privacy. Does the app live up to standards of regulation?
我们考察其可信度：它是否有科学依据证明该产品确实有效？它是否基于循证技术？我们考察用户体验：它是否易于学习、易于使用、易于导航？是否没有技术故障？我们还考察数据安全和隐私相关的问题：该应用是否符合监管标准？

7
00:02:53.000 --> 00:03:18.000
Does it keep your data safe? Does it not sell your data to third-party individuals? And I think all these things are things that should figure into a decision on whether an app might be a reasonable product for you to try to be able to promote your own mental health and wellness. How do you, at the Cyber Guide, decide which apps to review since there's so many out there covering such a range of conditions? Yeah, it's a good question when we get asked a lot. It's a little bit of an art and a little bit of a science.
它是否能保证你的数据安全？它是否不会将你的数据出售给第三方？我认为所有这些因素都应该纳入决策中，帮助你判断某个应用是否是一款适合你尝试、以促进自身心理健康和福祉的合理产品。既然市面上有那么多应用，涵盖了如此广泛的状况，你们“网络导向”是如何决定评测哪些应用的呢？是的，这是一个很好的问题，也是我们经常被问到的问题。这既有点像门艺术，又有点像门科学。

8
00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:59.000
And so, you know, we really want to focus on products that people are using. So we look at the number of downloads and the use of those products by consumers. We want to focus on products that are backed by science. And so we constantly are looking at the scientific literature in terms of, you know, what works, what is evidence behind it. We also want to focus on things that are useful for people. And so we focus on products that fit the needs of different consumers. We have partnerships with various organizations and they help us figure out what products they're constituents are interested in. And so I think the processes that we use to identify what products
因此，你知道，我们确实希望专注于人们正在使用的产品。所以我们会查看下载量以及消费者对这些产品的实际使用情况。我们希望专注于有科学依据的产品。因此，我们一直在查阅科学文献，看看什么有效，背后有什么证据。我们还希望专注于对人们有用 Dinge。因此，我们专注于符合不同消费者需求的产品。我们与各种组织建立了合作关系，他们帮助我们了解其成员对哪些产品感兴趣。因此，我认为我们用来确定要研究的产品

9
