or going to the app stores to leave those ratings. So I don't mean that to say that I don't think consumer, the impact on consumers and the benefits from consumers and the views of consumers are important. I just think it's a tricky thing to figure out how to collect systematically in an unbiased fashion. Like we try to do what the work we do at One Mind Cyber Guide. And it's something that we're still trying to figure out
只有那些有很好体验的人才会去应用商店留下这些评分。所以，我这么说并不是认为消费者的影响、消费者获得的益处以及消费者的看法不重要。我只是觉得，如何以公正的方式系统地收集这些信息是一件很棘手的事情，就像我们在“同一个心智网络导向”努力做的那样。这也是我们仍在摸索的事情，

