the best way to be able to incorporate. So I would really hope that that would be something that One Mind Cyber Guide would be using in the future, but I think it's still a really important open question about how to best collect that information. Yeah, kind of risky, like using Yelp to choose the restaurant where you want to eat tonight. Well, and I think that's a great point. And I think, you know, I sort of, I love restaurants, so I like the metaphor. I liked when we used to be able to go to them.
以便找到能够将其纳入其中的最佳方式。所以我真的很希望“同一个心智网络导向”在未来能够使用这一点，但我认为，如何最好地收集这些信息仍然是一个非常重要且有待解决的问题。是的，这有点冒险，就像用Yelp来选择你今晚想去哪家餐馆吃饭一样。嗯，我认为这是一个很好的观点。而且，你知道，我挺喜欢餐馆的，所以我很喜欢这个隐喻。我很怀念我们以前还能去餐馆的时候。

